of Málaga</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n<p>His professional experience includes:</p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li>Applied data science and artificial intelligence in public-sector environments (Madrid City Council)</li>\n    <li>Participation in European and national research projects in health informatics and interoperability</li>\n    <li>Development of data-driven systems, predictive models, and business intelligence solutions</li>\n    <li>Leadership and coordination of digital infrastructure and analytics initiatives</li>\n  </ul>\n```\n\nHe has been teaching in higher education for over a decade and actively contributes to academic innovation initiatives.\n:::\n\n## 🧑‍🎓 Research Profiles\n\n::: intro-block\nHis professional and academic profiles provide access to publications, collaborations, datasets, repositories, and teaching activities related to data science, artificial intelligence, urban sustainability, STEM education, and open science.\n\nConnect with him through:\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"footer-icons\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cacerestj/\" title=\"Linkedin\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=IHPgogMAAAAJ\" title=\"Google Scholar\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/scholar.png\" alt=\"Google Scholar\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0958-6688\" title=\"Orcid\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/orcid.png\" alt=\"ORCID\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Jesus-Tello\" title=\"Researchgate\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/researchgate.png\" alt=\"ResearchGate\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row g-3\">\n```\n:::\n\n## 🤝 Collaboration\n\n::: intro-block\nHe welcomes collaboration in:\n\n```{=html}\n<ul>\n  <li>Urban sustainability analytics</li>\n  <li>Methodological AI evaluation</li>\n  <li>Reproducible research frameworks</li>\n  <li>Hybrid predictive systems</li>\n  <li>Public-sector data science and AI</li>\n  <li>AI-enhanced STEM education</li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n</div>\n:::\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n::: secondary-subtitle\nMethodological Artificial Intelligence · Urban Data Science · Reproducible Analytical Systems\n:::\n\n:::: {style=\"display:flex; flex-wrap:nowrap; gap:2.5px; align-items:center; overflow-x:auto; white-space:nowrap; margin-bottom:10px; \"} \n<a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0958-6688\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ORCID-0000--0003--0958--6688-A6CE39?logo=orcid&amp;logoColor=white\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=IHPgogMAAAAJ\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Google%20Scholar-Citations-4285F4?logo=google-scholar&amp;logoColor=white\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Jesus-Tello\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/ResearchGate-Profile-00CCBB?logo=researchgate&amp;logoColor=white\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://zenodo.org/search?q=creators.name=%22Caceres-Tello%22\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Zenodo-Open%20Science-F16061?logo=zenodo&amp;logoColor=white\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.zotero.org/jcaceres_academic\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Zotero-References-CC2936?logo=zotero&amp;logoColor=white\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/> </a>\n\n<a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cacerestj/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/LinkedIn-Network-0A66C2?logo=linkedin&amp;logoColor=white\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/> </a>\n\n::: {style=\"display:flex; align-items:center;\"}\n<img src=\"https://visitor-badge.laobi.icu/badge?page_id=jcaceres.home\" style=\"height:19px; display:block;\"/>\n:::\n::::\n\n------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\n![](images/profile4.png){width=\"170\" style=\"border-radius:5%;float:left; margin-right:25px;margin-bottom:15px;\"}\n\n## 🔬 Research Identity\n\n::: intro-block\n**Methodological Artificial Intelligence · Urban Data Science · Reproducible Analytical Systems**\n\nJesús Cáceres-Tello holds a PhD in Data Science from the Complutense University of Madrid, with a research focus on methodological artificial intelligence and urban data science. He combines academic research with extensive experience in public sector digital systems and applied data science.\n\nHis work focuses on the evaluation of predictive models under real-world constraints, with emphasis on:\n\n-   Urban environmental modelling and air quality forecasting\n-   Machine learning under class imbalance\n-   Time series forecasting and temporal validation\n-   Hybrid and deep learning architectures\n-   Performance–cost trade-off analysis\n-   Reproducible research and open science frameworks\n-   AI-supported STEM education\n\nHis research contributes to the development of transparent, reproducible, and operational AI systems for sustainable urban environments.\n:::\n\n## 🎯 Research Mission\n\n::: intro-block\nHis research aims to develop methodologically robust and reproducible approaches for the evaluation and application of artificial intelligence and data science in complex real-world environments.\n\nThis includes:\n\n- Evaluating predictive models under real-world constraints\n- Designing reproducible and traceable analytical pipelines\n- Analysing performance–cost and robustness trade-offs\n- Integrating computational efficiency into model evaluation\n- Supporting data-driven decision-making in urban and institutional contexts\n- Exploring responsible applications of emerging AI technologies\n\nHis research is developed within a broader programme focused on methodological AI, urban data science, and reproducible analytical systems.\n:::\n\n## 🏗 Research Infrastructure & Open Science\n\n::: intro-block\nAll research is developed following open science and reproducibility principles.\n\nAll research projects are developed within a structured computational framework:\n\n-   Git-based version control\n-   Public repositories with DOI integration (Zenodo)\n-   Reproducible scripts and notebooks (R, Python, Quarto)\n-   Time-based validation strategies\n-   Transparent and standardised performance reporting\n\nEach publication is supported by:\n\n-   An open repository\n-   Executable code\n-   Structured documentation\n-   Publicly accessible data sources\n\nThis approach ensures traceability, transparency, and methodological consistency across all research outputs.\n:::\n\n## 📚 Publications & Open Repositories\n\nAll publications are accompanied by open repositories, executable code, and reproducible workflows.\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"accordion\" id=\"publicationsAccordion\">\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingExperimentalFragility\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseExperimentalFragility\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseExperimentalFragility\">\n        <strong>Experimental Fragility in AI-Based Predictive Systems</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2026&nbsp;·&nbsp;AIKP 2026\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseExperimentalFragility\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingExperimentalFragility\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          Reproducible framework for evaluating Experimental Fragility, temporal validation and distribution shift in AI-based predictive systems.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/aikp26_experimental_fragility/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/aikp26_experimental_fragility/notebook.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-success\">💻 Notebook</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/aikp26_experimental_fragility/scripts.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/aikp26_experimental_fragility\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n          <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23844283\" target=\"_blank\">📚 Zenodo</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingUrbanMethodology\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseUrbanMethodology\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseUrbanMethodology\">\n        <strong>Urban PM2.5 Methodology</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2026&nbsp;·&nbsp;Manuscript under review · Springer Nature\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseUrbanMethodology\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingUrbanMethodology\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          Reproducible methodological pipeline for urban PM2.5 time series analysis.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-methodology/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-methodology/notebook.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-success\">💻 Notebook</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-methodology/scripts.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/urban-pm25-methodology\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingImbalance\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseImbalance\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseImbalance\">\n        <strong>Urban PM2.5 Imbalance Evaluation Framework</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2026&nbsp;·&nbsp;Manuscript under review · Delta\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseImbalance\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingImbalance\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          Imbalance-aware classification and performance–cost trade-off analysis.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-imbalance-evaluation/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-imbalance-evaluation/scripts.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/urban-pm25-imbalance-evaluation\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingForecasting\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseForecasting\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseForecasting\">\n        <strong>Urban PM2.5 Forecasting Framework</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2024&nbsp;·&nbsp;AppliedMaths\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseForecasting\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingForecasting\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          Reproducible forecasting framework for urban PM2.5 time series using hybrid AI models.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-forecasting/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/appliedmath4040076\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\">📄 Article</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-forecasting/notebooks.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-success\">💻 Notebook</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-forecasting/scripts.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/urban-pm25-forecasting\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingGreenTechnology\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseGreenTechnology\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseGreenTechnology\">\n        <strong>Behavioural and Institutional Drivers of Green Technology Adoption</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2026&nbsp;·&nbsp;Frontiers in Psychology\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseGreenTechnology\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingGreenTechnology\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          TAM-based framework for sustainability transitions.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/extended-tam-green-technology/about.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3389/fpsyg.2026.1723942\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\">📄 Article</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/extended-tam-green-technology/scripts.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/extended-tam-green-technology\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingCitizenScience\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseCitizenScience\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseCitizenScience\">\n        <strong>Citizen Science and STEM Education with R</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2025&nbsp;·&nbsp;Applied Sciences\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseCitizenScience\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingCitizenScience\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          Reproducible AI–IoT forecasting and learning from open urban air and meteorological data.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/OpenUrbanAirandMeteorological/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/app152212183\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\">📄 Article</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/OpenUrbanAirandMeteorological/notebook.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-success\">💻 Notebook</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/OpenUrbanAirandMeteorological\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n\n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n    <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingQuantumEducation\">\n      <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n              data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n              data-bs-target=\"#collapseQuantumEducation\"\n              aria-expanded=\"false\"\n              aria-controls=\"collapseQuantumEducation\">\n        <strong>Quantum Computing in Data Science and STEM Education</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2025&nbsp;·&nbsp;Computers\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div id=\"collapseQuantumEducation\"\n         class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n         aria-labelledby=\"headingQuantumEducation\"\n         data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n      <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n        <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n          Bibliometric mapping and pedagogical analysis of quantum computing tools.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/quantum-computing-stem-education/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n          <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/computers14060235\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-primary\">📄 Article</a>\n          <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/quantum-computing-stem-education/scripts.html\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/quantum-computing-stem-education\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"accordion-item\">\n  <div class=\"accordion-header\" id=\"headingClassicalQuantumPM25\">\n    <button class=\"accordion-button collapsed\" type=\"button\"\n            data-bs-toggle=\"collapse\"\n            data-bs-target=\"#collapseClassicalQuantumPM25\"\n            aria-expanded=\"false\"\n            aria-controls=\"collapseClassicalQuantumPM25\">\n      <strong>Classical and Quantum PM2.5 Predictive Models</strong>&nbsp;·&nbsp;2025&nbsp;·&nbsp;Mathematics\n    </button>\n  </div>\n\n  <div id=\"collapseClassicalQuantumPM25\"\n       class=\"accordion-collapse collapse\"\n       aria-labelledby=\"headingClassicalQuantumPM25\"\n       data-bs-parent=\"#publicationsAccordion\">\n\n    <div class=\"accordion-body\">\n\n      <p class=\"text-muted mb-2\">\n        Mathematical and computational comparison of classical LSTM and quantum QSVM models for urban PM2.5 prediction.\n      </p>\n\n      <div class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 small\">\n\n        <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-classical-quantum/\"\n           target=\"_blank\"\n           class=\"text-dark\">🌐 Project</a>\n\n        <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.3390/math13121979\"\n           target=\"_blank\"\n           class=\"text-primary\">📄 Article</a>\n\n        <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-classical-quantum/notebook.html\"\n           target=\"_blank\"\n           class=\"text-success\">💻 Notebook</a>\n\n        <a href=\"https://jcaceres-academic.github.io/urban-pm25-classical-quantum/scripts.html\"\n           target=\"_blank\"\n           class=\"text-warning\">🧪 Scripts</a>\n\n        <a href=\"https://github.com/jcaceres-academic/urban-pm25-classical-quantum\"\n           target=\"_blank\"\n           class=\"text-secondary\">💾 Repository</a>\n\n        <a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23880802\"\n           target=\"_blank\"\n           class=\"text-info\">📚 Zenodo</a>\n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n```\n\n## 🎓 Academic Background & Professional Experience\n\n::: intro-block\nJesús Cáceres-Tello holds:\n\n```{=html}\n  <ul>\n    <li>Ph.D. in Data Science, Faculty of Statistical Studies, Complutense University of Madrid (2026)</li>\n  \n    <li>Master’s Degree in Artificial Intelligence, IoT and Big Data for Digital Transformation, INESEM Business School (2024)</li>\n  \n    <li>Master’s Degree in Educational Informatics, University of Alcalá</li>\n  \n    <li>B.Sc. in Information Systems Engineering, Catholic University of Ávila</li>\n  \n    <li>Diploma in Computer Science (Business Informatics), University of Málaga</li>\n  </ul>\n  \n<p>His professional experience includes:</p>\n  \n  <ul>\n    <li>Applied data science and artificial intelligence in public-sector environments (Madrid City Council)</li>\n    <li>Participation in European and national research projects in health informatics and interoperability</li>\n    <li>Development of data-driven systems, predictive models, and business intelligence solutions</li>\n    <li>Leadership and coordination of digital infrastructure and analytics initiatives</li>\n  </ul>\n```\n\nHe has been teaching in higher education for over a decade and actively contributes to academic innovation initiatives.\n:::\n\n## 🧑‍🎓 Research Profiles\n\n::: intro-block\nHis professional and academic profiles provide access to publications, collaborations, datasets, repositories, and teaching activities related to data science, artificial intelligence, urban sustainability, STEM education, and open science.\n\nConnect with him through:\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"footer-icons\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/cacerestj/\" title=\"Linkedin\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/linkedin.png\" alt=\"LinkedIn\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://scholar.google.es/citations?user=IHPgogMAAAAJ\" title=\"Google Scholar\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/scholar.png\" alt=\"Google Scholar\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0958-6688\" title=\"Orcid\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/orcid.png\" alt=\"ORCID\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Jesus-Tello\" title=\"Researchgate\" target=\"_blank\">\n    <img src=\"images/researchgate.png\" alt=\"ResearchGate\">\n  </a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row g-3\">\n```\n:::\n\n## 🤝 Collaboration\n\n::: intro-block\nHe welcomes collaboration in:\n\n```{=html}\n<ul>\n  <li>Urban sustainability analytics</li>\n  <li>Methodological AI evaluation</li>\n  <li>Reproducible research frameworks</li>\n  <li>Hybrid predictive systems</li>\n  <li>Public-sector data science and AI</li>\n  <li>AI-enhanced STEM education</li>\n</ul>\n```\n\n</div>\n:::\n"},"formats":{"html":{"identifier":{"display-name":"HTML","target-format":"html","base-format":"html"},"execute":{"fig-width":7,"fig-height":5,"fig-format":"retina","fig-dpi":96,"df-print":"default","error":false,"eval":true,"cache":null,"freeze":"auto","echo":false,"output":true,"warning":false,"include":true,"keep-md":false,"keep-ipynb":false,"ipynb":null,"enabled":null,"daemon":null,"daemon-restart":false,"debug":false,"ipynb-filters":[],"ipynb-shell-interactivity":null,"plotly-connected":true,"engine":"markdown","message":false},"render":{"keep-tex":false,"keep-typ":false,"keep-source":false,"keep-hidden":false,"prefer-html":false,"output-divs":true,"output-ext":"html","fig-align":"default","fig-pos":null,"fig-env":null,"code-fold":"none","code-overflow":"wrap","code-link":false,"code-line-numbers":false,"code-too